OL,3,AContainer ship hit by projectile sinks
OL,4,Ain Strait of Hormuz, Singapore says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Singapore-flagged container ship has
OL,7,Fsunk after being struck by an unknown
OL,8,Fprojectile while transiting the Strait
OL,9,Fof Hormuz, according to Singaporean
OL,10,Fauthorities.
OL,12,FAll 21 crew members of GFS Pride were
OL,13,Fevacuated and no injuries were reported
OL,14,Fafter the attack on Tuesday, which
OL,15,Fcaused damage and a fire, the Maritime
OL,16,Fand Port Authority of Singapore said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
