OL,3,AContainer ship hit by projectile sinks
OL,4,Ain Strait of Hormuz, Singapore says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother Singapore-flagged container
OL,7,Fvessel, GFS Giselle, sustained hull
OL,8,Fdamage after being hit by a projectile
OL,9,Fon Wednesday but was able to reach a
OL,10,Fsafe anchorage with all 22 crew, it
OL,11,Fadded.
OL,13,FIran's Revolutionary Guards said a ship
OL,14,Fhit naval mines and sank while passing
OL,15,Fthrough what they called an
OL,16,F"unauthorised" route in the Strait of
OL,17,FHormuz.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
